<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, OCT 5.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, OCT 5.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Oct 5	 Oct 4	 DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  240.750     241.140     237.040    1.57 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  300.800     300.950     303.640   -0.94 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.250     157.550     165.490   -4.98 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.520	46.554	48.410   -3.90 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  376.560     377.360     366.280    2.81 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.180     140.435     147.886   -5.21 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.885	15.860	14.975    6.08 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  216.000     216.290     230.135   -6.14 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.870	 1.871	 1.939   -3.56 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.556	 1.557	 1.575   -1.21 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  191.575     191.860     206.030   -7.02 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
